## Key Concepts
- DP over prefix length i and blocks t with transition from a previous breakpoint j
- invCost(l,r) as block cost (inversions within subarray)
- Reconstruction pointers for block boundaries
- Time: O(n^2 k); Space: O(nk) or O(nk) with rolling arrays

## Code Example
